---LINES

mainv   = gh  - - - - "main view"
mainvk  = gc  - - - - "main view keys:"

cmded   = gh  - - - - "command editor"
cmdedk  = gc  - - - - "command editor keys:"

exit    = gh  - - - - "exit trap"
exitk   = gc  - - - - "keys of trap on exit:"

hist    = gh  - - - - "history view"
histk   = gc  - - - - "history view keys:"

runcmd  = gh  - - - - "run a command"

---# m       = gm  - - - - " *)"
m       = g  - - - - " *)"
a       = cx "{1}"
b       = cx "{2}"
c       = cx "{3}"

cmd     = ghx - - - -  "[a-z./]"
CMD     = ghx - - - -  "[A-Z0-9]"

---SCREEN
=vash workflow                                      
+                                      please, see 'man vash' for more details       
+.mainvk...............................                                       
+ .:CA - switch to editor                                                       
+ .'uppercase                               help:                       exit:   
+   execute predefined command   .a.        .:HE...                     .:EX... 
+   edit a command from template .b.        .mainv............................. 
+ .'lowercase                               .CMD.... .cmd...       <-- .:CA ^ 
+   type a command from scratch  .c.         :   :    :                  :  :   
+                                            :   :    :                  :  :   
+.cmdedk...............................      :   :   .c.  ."history"...  :  :   
+ .:HE... switch to history view             :  .b.   :   :     .:NL...  :  :   
+ .:NL... run a command, sync history       .a.  :    :   :          :   :  :   
+                                            :   :    :  .:HE...     : .:CA :   
+.histk................................      : .cmded...................... :   
+ .:CA    return to editor untouched         :   .:NL...          ^         :   
+ .:NL... take a command to editor           :     :              :         :  
+                                            :     :             .c.        :   
+.exitk................................     .runcmd..........     :       .:CA      
+ .:SP...| .:CA return to main view            -->          :   .cmd... .:SP...       
+ .'lovercase  return to editor                             .exit.............     
                                                                                
---END                                                                         
+  .:NL...  - defencive trap for mistakes   
+                                     .m. see 'man vash' for details
